=== 53 a session command lists its options ===
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/new
› -m      pick which model to use
  -c      configure access rights
  -t      replace current toolbox
  --yolo  run outside the sandbox
  -f      fork a previous session



────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
=== 54 choosing an option that takes a value goes on to its values ===
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/new -m
› anthropic/claude-sonnet-5@medium
  anthropic/claude-sonnet-5@high
  anthropic/claude-opus-5@high
  opencode-go/minimax-m3




────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
=== 55 choosing an option that takes nothing closes the dropdown ===
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/new --yolo
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
=== 56 a long option completes as itself ===
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/new --
› --model  pick which model to use
  --caps   configure access rights
  --tool   replace current toolbox
  --yolo   run outside the sandbox
  --from   fork a previous session



────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
=== 57 an option already given is not offered again ===
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/fork -m sonnet --yolo -
› -c  configure access rights
  -t  replace current toolbox
  -f  fork a previous session
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
=== 58 a capability option lists capabilities ===
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/fork -c
› r
  rx
  rxw
  rxws
  rxwsn
  rxwsng
  rxwsngl
  rxwsngla
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
=== 59 a waived sandbox lists only what it can take ===
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/fork -c
› s
  sl
  sla





────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
=== 60 a waived sandbox does not offer itself again ===
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/new -
› -m  pick which model to use
  -c  configure access rights
  -t  replace current toolbox
  -f  fork a previous session




